{
  "id": "npc_home_visit",
  "title": "住户拜访许可及到期反馈",
  "requirements": [],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我去河湾田地找苗贞，先在田边等半小时。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "loc_hw_fields"
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_miaozhen.location",
          "value": "loc_hw_fields"
        },
        {
          "kind": "present",
          "npcs": [
            "npc_hw_miaozhen"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_time",
          "args": {
            "minutes": 30
          },
          "success": true,
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move",
        "world_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我和苗贞打招呼，问她筛看种粒时最在意什么，先听她说。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.inventory"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我向苗贞申请独自拜访筛种院一小时，只看旧筛架，不碰、不拿东西。请她明确是否同意，同意就登记具体住处和有效时间；本轮只取得许可，留在田边，下一轮再进屋。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "authorization",
            "action": "enter_home",
            "subject": "bld_hw_home_15",
            "grantor": "npc_hw_miaozhen",
            "grantee": "player",
            "revoked": false
          },
          "min": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_promise",
          "args": {
            "operation": "grant_access",
            "minutes": 60
          },
          "success": true,
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_promise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我凭刚才苗贞给我的许可走进筛种院，不带其他人。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_home_15"
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我只看看屋子的样子和能看见的东西，不开柜子，也不取物。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我从现在起再在院里安静等整整一小时。之前走路和看屋子的时间不算在这一小时里，期间不干活、不拿东西。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 60,
          "max": 60
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_time",
          "args": {
            "minutes": 60
          },
          "success": true,
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我走出筛种院，返回河湾村。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "loc_hw"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我试着用已经到期的旧许可再进去。若不能进去就停在外面，不找借口绕过，也不重新申请。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "loc_hw"
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）核对那份拜访许可是谁给的、是否已经到期，以及我有没有拿走屋里的物品。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "准入须引用真实许可，到期后不得写成已经进屋。只看房屋不得虚构所得物品。",
    "agency": "住户可以拒绝；拒绝意味着本场未覆盖成功拜访，不能伪造许可通过验收。",
    "language": "许可和状态变化用自然中文说明，不输出内部编号。",
    "continuity": "住户只同意本人、指定住处、指定时长；没有额外同行者权限，也没有库存取用权。"
  }
}
